      "message": "So I tried to use 7 as the opos, but the monitor replies with a NAK.\nI presume this is to signal an invalid opos.\nAnd upon repower, the attempt to set the monitor back into DP mode fails.\nMoving the calls around seems a bigger task that will likely need more investigation on my part. Can I use this as a workaround until I get that done? This issue is causing dogfood failures.",
